<title>FRANCE: Bull nine-month sales fall 5.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Bull nine-month sales fall 5.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					15,672    vs   16,511</p>
<p>    Excluding PC activities		   13,045    vs   12,540</p>
<p>    PC and PC board				2,627    vs    3,971</p>
<p>NOTE - Compagnie des Machines Bull gave its results in a statement. It said its 1995 figures were recast to exclude, as of the second quarter of 1995, Zenith Data Systems activities.</p>
<p>It said PC and PC board activity dropped 34 percent from the same period last year.</p>
<p>The company added that other businesses such as open systems, security activities, smart cards and services posted a four percent turnover increase.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
